Syntax highlighting definitions
===============================

The language definitions in this folder and the colour schemes in ../styles
(except Meld's own meld-base.xml and meld-dark.xml) are copied unchanged from
GtkSourceView 5.22.0 (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtksourceview), the
library the original Meld highlights syntax with. They are data files read by
the port's own highlighting engine (src/core/syntax); no GtkSourceView code
is used. GtkSourceView's test files, testv1.lang and testdark.xml, aren't
included.

Each file carries its licence: the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or later, or (gdscript, logtalk, powershell, protobuf and spice)
the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.
